+  /**
+   * Replays the latest Android Surface only after C++ has attached the compositor's weak JNI
+   * owner. A newly-created product Session can become active before its asynchronous Gecko
+   * window exists; calling a generated native method during that interval dereferences an empty
+   * native handle.
